- Someone's gonna have a really eggy part of this timpano.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.000
- Yeah, there's no way this won't taste good.

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.270
Grating a little more pecorino on there.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.360
Now we're just havin' fun, I feel like Bob Ross.

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:26.790
Leftovers, we have three eggs, one meatball,

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:28.960
and like a quarter cup of pasta.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.703
How should we fold this together?

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:32.703
- Dude, I gotta try it once.

00:09:32.703 --> 00:09:33.923
What am I doing standing here?

00:09:36.855 --> 00:09:37.848
Look at this thing!

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:39.130
Oh my God.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:41.266
- That's like a solid 45 pounds.

00:09:41.266 --> 00:09:43.030
(laughing)

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:45.050
Alright, let's get this bad boy in the oven.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:49.189
Okay, it's been about 50 minutes to an hour.

00:09:49.189 --> 00:09:50.610
We're gonna take the lid off.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.450
Maybe we shouldn't have put the butter on top.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:53.340
- It's too brown?

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:54.650
- It's getting brown a little early.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.764
- You think it's gonna burn?
- I don't know.

00:09:55.764 --> 00:09:59.290
An hour and a half in on the timpano bake.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:01.880
A little bit concerned about the browning happening on top,

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.288
so we put some foil,

00:10:03.288 --> 00:10:06.750
which I think will help deflect the heat.

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.190
I'm gonna go on the record as saying

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:11.120
I think a little danger adds a lot of excitement to a meal.

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.823
It's been over two hours now.

00:10:15.130 --> 00:10:16.520
- Yes, yes.
- Oh, it's perfect!

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:18.840
- Great.
- We're gonna call that done.

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.613
We're going to unmold it.

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.750
Tell me about it, Adam.

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:24.990
Alright, here it comes, no hesitation.

00:10:28.794 --> 00:10:31.377
(all cheering)

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:35.273
Oh, yeah.
- That looks perfect.

00:10:35.343 --> 00:10:36.697
- I just wanna stand here and fan it, you know?

00:10:36.697 --> 00:10:38.473
I'm like, cool down already.

00:10:42.830 --> 00:10:43.663
We can eat it now?

00:10:43.663 --> 00:10:44.496
- Come on, everybody.

00:10:44.496 --> 00:10:46.363
Gather round for this feast.

00:10:46.593 --> 00:10:48.810
(cheering)

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.340
- Alright, let's get in there with a knife.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:51.286
- [Patrick] I support you.

00:10:51.286 --> 00:10:52.893
I give you my props here.
- I think you've just

00:10:52.893 --> 00:10:54.567
gotta commit.
- Come on.

00:10:54.567 --> 00:10:56.711
(all talking)

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:57.633
Oh, it's juicy.

00:10:57.633 --> 00:10:58.650
- [Patrick] Here we go.

00:11:01.482 --> 00:11:03.630
Oh boy, oh boy.

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:04.733
- Okay, the moment of truth.

00:11:04.733 --> 00:11:06.633
You guys ready for this?
- Hell yeah.

00:11:08.391 --> 00:11:09.743
- [Woman] What's inside?

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:12.933
- Oh, nice.

00:11:13.249 --> 00:11:15.499
(cheering)

00:11:16.633 --> 00:11:18.710
- Look at that, yeah, well done.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.293
There it is, yeah.

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:21.420
I cannot believe it.

00:11:21.420 --> 00:11:24.040
- [Andrew] I swear to god, if this falls on the ground...

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:24.943
- [All] Cheers.

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:27.480
- Earlier in the video, I drank from a bowl.

00:11:27.480 --> 00:11:28.490
Yeah, make it rain.

00:11:28.490 --> 00:11:29.466
That's the timpano.

00:11:29.466 --> 00:11:31.716
(clapping)

00:11:31.860 --> 00:11:32.783
- [Patrick] Well done.

00:11:34.400 --> 00:11:35.233
- Mm!

00:11:35.233 --> 00:11:36.513
Holy crap.
- Yeah, for real.

00:11:36.565 --> 00:11:38.102
- Its like a surprise in every bite.

00:11:38.102 --> 00:11:39.900
- I think this is the best thing you have ever made.

00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:41.743
- Rie gives it a blessing.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:43.640
I would probably leave the eggs out next time though.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.631
I don't know why the eggs are there, I don't know why.

00:11:45.631 --> 00:11:46.690
- The meatball is great.

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:48.590
- That ragu is just out of this world.

00:11:51.265 --> 00:11:52.098
- This is actually really good.

00:11:52.098 --> 00:11:54.730
Surprisers.
(laughing)

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.590
- [Andrew] That's gonna happen with a timpano.

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:57.330
I think that was a great success.

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:58.163
- [Patrick] Thank you, Babish.

00:11:58.163 --> 00:11:59.540
- [Andrew] I wouldn't not make it again.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:00.860
- [Patrick] I would love to make this again,

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:01.693
are you kidding me?

00:12:01.693 --> 00:12:02.526
This would be fun.

00:12:02.526 --> 00:12:04.508
- Yeah, it was a great time.
- It's just too much work.

00:12:04.508 --> 00:12:07.091
(upbeat music)

